# 统一换行符处理，并显式标记二进制资源，避免 Git 误做文本转换
* text=auto

# 签名配置不入库：提交时由 clean filter 自动剥离 signingConfigs
# （本地文件不受影响，构建照常可用；安装见 tools/setup-local-git.mjs）
build-profile.json5 filter=strip-signing

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.bin binary
*.gz binary
*.hap binary
*.p12 binary
*.cer binary
*.p7b binary
